GCP DevOps Interviews – Real Questions from My 'EPAM' Interview ☁️🔧

Hey #DevOps and #CloudCommunity!
 I recently had a 1.5-hour technical interview with EPAM Systems for a GCP DevOps Support Engineer role, and I wanted to share some of the real-world questions I was asked. Hope this helps others preparing for similar roles! 💡

🔹 GCP Networking & Migration
How would you migrate a running on-prem multi-tier app to GCP (networking + storage approach)?
What’s the difference between Layer 4 and Layer 7 Load Balancers?
Can TCP Proxy or Regional Load Balancers be made global?
What are public vs private subnets in GCP?
How can a private subnet VM access the internet?

🔹 IAM & Security
What is IAP (Identity-Aware Proxy)?
What is Workload Identity Federation?
How would you give temporary access (5–10 mins) to a GCS object?
What’s your IAM approach for read/write access to GCS buckets?

🔹 GKE & Kubernetes
How do you upgrade an Autopilot GKE cluster?
What are health check probes in Kubernetes?
A pod is crashing frequently—how would you troubleshoot?
How do you achieve auto-scaling in GCP?

🔹 Terraform & Infra as Code
What are count and for_each in Terraform?
What are provisioners in Terraform?
How do you copy a file from local to Terraform-managed infra?
How do you detect drift in Terraform?
How do you remove a specific resource from Terraform infra?
How do you implement dependencies in Terraform?
Can you delete a Terraform state file stored in GCS?

🔹 CI/CD & Observability
What are the stages in your CI/CD pipeline?
How do you set up centralized observability in GCP?
Do you need to install anything for Cloud Monitoring dashboards?
Have you configured Prometheus and Grafana from scratch?

🔹 Linux & Scripting
What’s the difference between du and df?
How do you show the last 10 lines of a file?
How do you replace a word that appears 20 times in a file?
Given a Linux script, can you explain it and make a deployment.yaml production-ready?

🔹 Cost Optimization & Access Control
How can you reduce the cost of a running instance?
How do you change instance type from e2 to n2 in a Managed Instance Group?
How do you apply the same firewall rule (e.g., port 22 & 80) to 10 instances?
What’s the use of tags in GCP?
How would you connect two GCP projects across different organizations?
 
